<body class="marketing-page">
	<SiteNav />

	<main>

	<section class="hero alt-hero">
		<div class="hero-badge">Alternatives · Self-Hosted</div>
		<h1>The Mail-in-a-Box alternative<br/><span>built for production.</span></h1>
		<p class="alt-lead">
			Mail-in-a-Box gives you a one-command personal email box on a single Ubuntu VPS.
			Vectis Mail is API-first, multi-domain mail infrastructure for teams and SaaS — a
			self-hosted transactional sending API and inbound webhooks alongside your mailboxes,
