					<tr><th scope="row">Target user</th><td><strong>Teams, SaaS, multi-domain operators</strong></td><td>Individuals, families, single-org</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Mail stack</th><td>Postfix · Dovecot · Rspamd</td><td>Postfix · Dovecot · SpamAssassin</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Deployment model</th><td>Docker Compose</td><td>One-command shell script (OS-native)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Supported OS</th><td><strong>Linux (Ubuntu, Debian, RHEL family) with Docker</strong></td><td>Ubuntu 22.04 LTS only (fresh install)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Install difficulty</th><td>Guided installer, ~20 min</td><td>One command, ~15 min</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Configuration model</th><td><strong>Declarative YAML + <code>vectis apply</code></strong></td><td>Web control panel · no config-as-code</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">REST API</th><td><strong>40+ endpoints</strong> (sending, webhooks, domains, mailboxes, analytics)</td><td>Minimal admin API only · no sending API</td></tr>
